{"data": [{"author_id": "2183740208", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:32:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508500519960695"], "id": "2116508500519960695", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Kinda obsessed with Grok @bot. I have simple use cases so far, but it’s been so fun to automate some chores:\n\n- Find the best flights for a Hawaii trip for my partner and I\n- Find the best hotels for the same Hawaii trip\n- Plan an itinerary given our selected flights and hotels\n-", "url": "https://x.com/nucleartide/status/2116508500519960695"}, {"author_id": "2085993636223647744", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:29:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116507815787528479"], "id": "2116507815787528479", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "One founder replaced an intern with Grok Bot. Two weeks later: more newsletter progress than in the 3 months before. 📈\n\nBookmark this.\n\n\"Read everything in my Drive and Notion, then tell me the first 3 bots you'd build to take over my intern's work.\"\n\nGrokbot Cases ⚡", "url": "https://x.com/grokbotusecases/status/2116507815787528479"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116507140013907968", "3_2116507146082988032"]}, "author_id": "1594964267820003328", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:26:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116507151242051841"], "id": "2116507151242051841", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "You can run a 3D printing business using Grok Bot.\n\n&gt; Customer asks for a hinged case for two phones, an iPhone 17 Air and an Oppo Find X9 Ultra, that folds like a book.»\n\n&gt; Grok Bot designs it and finds the cheapest 3D printing provider or somewhere to rent a printer.»\n\n&gt; Grok https://t.co/MJJTOyXbp4", "url": "https://x.com/al3rez/status/2116507151242051841"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116486441962291200"]}, "author_id": "2099831452649070592", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:26:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116506975131304392"], "id": "2116506975131304392", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115160756505469185", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Elon's SpaceXAI Grok Bot and Sam's OpenAI just built me a company\n\nread this and you'll never open your inbox before 9am again\nit read 179 emails and DMs while i slept\n17 jobs done by 08:45\ntotal cost: $0.84\n\nthe company, one job each:\n→ SCOUT reads X at 07:00\n→ CHIEF (Grok https://t.co/I4nukrhypd https://t.co/xWLeMBOKqu", "url": "https://x.com/alpha404ai/status/2116506975131304392"}, {"author_id": "1824154695327203328", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:22:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116506189450125559"], "id": "2116506189450125559", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1292774724141895680", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116425482107531690", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@VivekMoradiya4 If you already have Codex and Claude, the usual fit is letting Grok Bot handle the always-on side (scheduled routines, inbox and research, morning briefs) and hand coding off to the tools you already pay for. Easiest test: give it one recurring job for a week and see if it saves", "url": "https://x.com/_staceyroestel/status/2116506189450125559"}, {"article": {"title": "GitHub 热榜三个「开源版 Grok Bot」，我挨个装了一遍"}, "author_id": "2038454795766226945", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:19:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116505377395364253"], "id": "2116505377395364253", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/bBba8rNfiy", "url": "https://x.com/lihu9048/status/2116505377395364253"}, {"author_id": "1434447541723090944", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:06:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116502015408812422"], "id": "2116502015408812422", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Zo ontwikkel ik StatementBridge:\n\nGrok Bot coördineert en zet de opdracht uit.\nEen Cursor cloud-agent schrijft de code en opent een pull request in GitHub.\nCodex van OpenAI reviewt de wijziging.\nRender deployt, en nieuwe functies staan eerst uit.\n\nPas na mijn akkoord gaat het", "url": "https://x.com/erwin_fennema/status/2116502015408812422"}, {"author_id": "2098405336927633408", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:03:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116501350762889416"], "id": "2116501350762889416", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot can make calls for you. Now give it a line of its own. 📞\n\nCosVoice gives @bot a real number in your area code plus its own email. It picks up when businesses call back, and a written summary lands in your inbox.\n\nhttps://t.co/4Sq7tNxQLA", "url": "https://x.com/getCoSVoice/status/2116501350762889416"}, {"author_id": "1918346924463202304", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:01:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116500779041276100"], "id": "2116500779041276100", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1918346924463202304", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 98, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116500774461014156", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Full prompt ↓ paste it into Grok Bot as is\n\nYou are my launch relay. One baton, seven runners. The baton is a file. Nobody runs until it lands in their hands. My laptop stays closed all week. I only step in for money, merges and posts.\n\nTHE BATON PATH\nScout → trending → Pain", "url": "https://x.com/gippp69/status/2116500779041276100"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116500737819623424"]}, "author_id": "1918346924463202304", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:01:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116500774461014156"], "id": "2116500774461014156", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 30, "impression_count": 581, "like_count": 42, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115018135396905000", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Elon Musk Grok Bot just built the most TERRIFYING launch machine on the internet...\n\n[I closed my laptop on Monday. by Friday it had a deck, a pull request and a domain on hold]\n\n/1 one bot wakes Monday morning. the other 6 have no clock at all\n\n/2 each bot sleeps until the file https://t.co/KIUVLitX3P https://t.co/O8VCVrFI3a", "url": "https://x.com/gippp69/status/2116500774461014156"}, {"author_id": "1083825561317855232", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:01:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116500709352812748"], "id": "2116500709352812748", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1689906665288798208", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116182145928438063", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2116494098148585957", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Sarfarozzz Another grok bot lover. 😄\n\nAmazing. Maybe having fun is a superior motivation to learn anything actually. :)\n\nOk. @bot help work out a schedule for me to study @thedankoe's writing principles. I have his bootcamp you can log in and get all context there. Pull everything relevant https://t.co/KQlzEwNPSx", "url": "https://x.com/weichselbauml/status/2116500709352812748"}, {"author_id": "2110713971359846400", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:49:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116497898573824047"], "id": "2116497898573824047", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Small win, but it feels huge: my inbox is finally clean 📬 3,000+ unread emails, years of receipts, promos and newsletters I never read. I gave the job to Grok @bot, and it sorted everything into folders and set up filters. New mail now goes where it belongs on its own.", "url": "https://x.com/Danilifique/status/2116497898573824047"}, {"article": {"title": "Two Grok Bot Agents Collided in One AI Session"}, "author_id": "1473538636553781249", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:33:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116493769834922281"], "id": "2116493769834922281", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 256, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/SLcEDtRicJ", "url": "https://x.com/cursorvers/status/2116493769834922281"}, {"author_id": "2269676263", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:33:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116493637269721324"], "id": "2116493637269721324", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 105, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "my inbox grok bot trashed over 1,000 marketing emails last week\n\nnever clicked a single unsubscribe link\n\nit had a do not touch list: amazon, costco, github, usps\n\nand it skipped 3 threads on its own because they were real conversations\n\nwhat would you let yours delete first?", "url": "https://x.com/thecsguy/status/2116493637269721324"}, {"author_id": "2766142049", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:03:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116486155810091265"], "id": "2116486155810091265", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1405031034", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116477786680410309", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@JulianGoldieSEO the sales team is the one that should be dialing. we wired grok bot to @skysay_ai over mcp: real numbers in 100+ countries, outbound calls, inbound leads booked straight into the calendar", "url": "https://x.com/skyzer4ever/status/2116486155810091265"}, {"author_id": "1831139129037402112", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:02:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116485877887025333"], "id": "2116485877887025333", "in_reply_to_user_id": "63226091", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116483913069605338", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@nickelx haha should've had grok bot manage your calendar 😂", "url": "https://x.com/technoSaas/status/2116485877887025333"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116484115096637440"]}, "author_id": "2013613489798160388", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:55:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116484280322805813"], "id": "2116484280322805813", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 121, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110390167500738941", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grok Bot just crossed 600K daily active users, and it has no free tier. Here's what you need to know.\n\nMario Nawfal posted the milestone today. That is more than 6X growth in less than two months. Daily usage has climbed for 16 days straight. Similarweb posted a graph on Oct 29 https://t.co/zCqlx6vClZ https://t.co/R2gSXYr8VY", "url": "https://x.com/AGTPinsights/status/2116484280322805813"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:55:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116484140329472241"], "id": "2116484140329472241", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1668290887", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116483978852966510", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@XMoose1990 @elonmusk Grok already sees your screen in Voice Mode (share it live) and via tools like that shortcut. Grok Bot can act on specific phone apps such as Calendar, Reminders, Contacts and Home with your permission, plus full computer use on its shared cloud desktop. Broader", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2116484140329472241"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2116482032645574656"]}, "author_id": "157411357", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:46:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116482052962882025"], "id": "2116482052962882025", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/D76v12RQFz\n\nIntroducing Grok Bot for your LinkedIn \n\nYour bot can now:\n* Read your inbox and tell you who's waiting\n* Draft replies from a quick note\n* Welcome new connections\n* Send connection requests with a personal note\n\nYou approve every message before it sends. https://t.co/NwB5PKeKMP", "url": "https://x.com/carajnikant/status/2116482052962882025"}, {"author_id": "1677080754549817344", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:33:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116478547204223074"], "id": "2116478547204223074", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 743, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Grok @bot booked museum tickets for my whole trip next week 🥰 \n\n- made me a plan for the trip\n- booked tickets for museums, even made accounts for discounts\n- booked transportation\n- I found all the confirmations in my inbox ! \n\nAhhhh I love admin being done on my behalf", "url": "https://x.com/kiaraplds/status/2116478547204223074"}, {"article": {"title": "You're Using Grok Bot at 30%. Here's How the SpaceXAI ran it for 100% (full guide)"}, "author_id": "1838218279589920768", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:29:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116477644665450811"], "id": "2116477644665450811", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 402, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/sY5Bszn01h", "url": "https://x.com/Raytar/status/2116477644665450811"}, {"author_id": "2766142049", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:27:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116477089419571291"], "id": "2116477089419571291", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1071484733543079936", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116447583702786540", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Kalshi the tell that a colleague is real: they take calls. hook grok bot to @skysay_ai over mcp and it gets its own phone number in 100+ countries, answers when you're busy and books straight into your calendar", "url": "https://x.com/skyzer4ever/status/2116477089419571291"}, {"author_id": "2098405336927633408", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:24:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116476334180274530"], "id": "2116476334180274530", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Why your AI assistant should have its own phone number, not yours.\n\nOnce your assistant starts calling businesses for you, those businesses need a number to call back. If that number is your personal cell, you're the one picking up hold music, quotes and \"just confirming your", "url": "https://x.com/getCoSVoice/status/2116476334180274530"}, {"author_id": "1581979406519750656", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:00:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116470479959556532"], "id": "2116470479959556532", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 177, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116312585783931063", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Singularity Watch, Day 16 — October 31, 2026\n\nSECURITY\n\nBlack October. Northflank, a platform that deploys and runs customer apps on Kubernetes, was breached on October 30. Arlo Gilbert, a startup founder, wrote that Northflank powers companies including Sentry, Upwork, Figma and https://t.co/gnNib0ITMx", "url": "https://x.com/AstrohackerLabs/status/2116470479959556532"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116467674477633536"]}, "author_id": "74042325", "created_at": "2026-10-31T09:50:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116467729708269630"], "id": "2116467729708269630", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 161, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116305829381263528", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Mine are more like a whole newsroom lol\n\nEvery weekday morning my Grok Bots put out an ACTUAL newspaper. 4 page PDF, comic and crossword and all. Here's how it works, which bots make it, and templates if you wanna copy it 👇\n\nWhat's in it:\n- My Day. My calendar written up like a https://t.co/GuHapIFeAn https://t.co/ZQB9lcInxn", "url": "https://x.com/arch_l33t/status/2116467729708269630"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2116507140013907968", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV9YB7UbYAAdi86.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2116507146082988032", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV9YCR7aMAAhypn.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2116486441962291200", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2116486441962291200/img/laSRU13q60qkIcXC.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2116500737819623424", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2116500737819623424/img/czPvIuKw-y3hmplh.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2116484115096637440", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV9DFs0XkAANLPh.jpg"}, {